===Etymology===
Inherited from Mediaeval {{inh|el|gkm|πατέρας}}, from {{inh|el|grc|πατήρ}} throuth the accusative singular {{m|grc|πατέρα}},<ref>{{R:DSMG}}</ref> from {{inh|el|grk-pro|*patḗr}}, from {{inh|el|ine-pro|*ph₂tḗr}}. {{doublet|el|πατήρ}}.

